he package's Excel recap tables (a per-village recap with colored cells). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Open-sided village posyandu hall in the morning: a plastic-covered table with a baby hanging scale, a handwritten cadre notebook, a stack of pink maternal handbooks without readable text, a laptop, colorful plastic chairs, two cadres and mothers with babies only as blurred shapes in the background, bright natural daylight. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: a handwritten cadre notebook (no readable text) next to a phone screen with a blurred list; cut to medium shot as she looks up to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Catatan kader dan puskesmas beda." Delivery (EN): puzzled, low voice 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she flips a page of the notebook, phone still in her other hand. VO (ID, verbatim): "Jumlah kunjungannya tidak sama." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she glances at the blurred mothers waiting, then back to camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya tidak tahu yang benar." Delivery (EN): worried 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she sets the notebook and phone down side by side. VO (ID, verbatim): "Laporan bulanan jadi diragukan." Delivery (EN): quiet, firm 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she adjusts the baby scale and exhales. VO: none. AUDIO: Morning village ambience, distant baby sounds and soft chatter, a rooster far away. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box, printed checklist, laptop screen, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.